# Stable short aliases. Point these at the current version.
# NOTE: /map is NOT an alias. map.html IS the live map page, served directly at /map,
# so browsers never cache a redirect to a versioned filename. On a version bump,
# replace the contents of map.html; do not create a new versioned page at the root.
# Superseded map URLs 301 to /map. Only v2.6 is retained, at /archive/ransomware-ecosystem-v2.6.html;
# versions v1.3 through v2.5 were retired 31 Jul 2026 (copies kept off-site in ransomware_project/_archive).
# /observatory is NOT an alias, for the same reason /map is not. observatory.html
# IS the page, and Cloudflare Pages serves it at /observatory natively because it
# auto-redirects .html to extensionless. An explicit "/observatory
# /observatory.html 200" rule was added on 22 Aug 2026 and created a redirect
# loop: /observatory rewrote to /observatory.html, Pages bounced that back to
# /observatory, forever, and the URL returned an empty response. Do not re-add it.
#
# Live Intel retired into the Observatory console, 22 Aug 2026. Its live feed is
# now the console's Live Feed tab. NOTE the standing rule: Cloudflare serves an
# existing file in preference to a _redirects rule, so ransomware-live-intel.html
# had to be removed for these to fire. A copy is in ransomware_project/_to_delete.
/intel      /observatory                           301
/ransomware-live-intel.html  /observatory          301
/ransomware-live-intel       /observatory          301
/wanted     /most-wanted.html                      200
/modules    /ransomware-edp-modules-v1.0.html      200
/lenses     /ransomware-role-lenses-v0.1.html      200
/lineage    /tools/ransomware-lineage-explorer.html 200
/toolkits   /tools/ransomware-toolkit-profiles-v2.html 200
/expose     /ransomware-expose-v1.0.html           200
/primer     /ransomware-for-dummies-v1.0.html      200
/enablement /enablement-layer.html                 200

# Enablement Layer promoted out of the BPH library to top level, 28 Jul 2026.
# The /bphs/ URL was published, so it must keep resolving.
/bphs/enablement-layer.html   /enablement-layer.html   301
/bphs/enablement-layer        /enablement-layer.html   301

